{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Rangers is an isometric space RPG where every journey beyond the inhabited systems could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game takes place in the distant future, when humanity has already mastered interstellar travel. You arrive in a remote star system on the edge of the galaxy, where civilization is barely holding on after a devastating war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The fleet has not yet been rebuilt, communication is unstable, and resource extraction zones have been taken over by unknown forces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a ship, explore dangerous sectors of space, and make decisions that affect the survival of people in this system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In the game, you will:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Fight space pirates and other threats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2c Explore and discover new technologies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Search for and rescue survivors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\ude80 Develop the skills of the captain and crew members</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Rangers is a story about survival, exploration, and people who go where others dare not.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2276080?t=1766757678","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276080/112ca9789306e4ca812cbac26b744a299cb0781e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766757678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276080/602300f3ab1d34e0a71ecb57ff90d0cfcd126f7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766757678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276080/602300f3ab1d34e0a71ecb57ff90d0cfcd126f7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766757678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes